category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Implementation of the ITU G.722 specification (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The G.722 module is a bit exact implementation of the ITU G.722 specification
for all three specified bit rates - 64000bps, 56000bps and 48000bps. It passes
the ITU tests."
